      {
        "id": "outcome_request_revision",
        "description": "At priority 10, explicitly allow candidate request_revision with score 0 when acceptance_checks_status is incomplete or evidence_status is incomplete. A failed but completed check is not treated as an incomplete check; this rule does not independently authorize revision for failed checks with complete evidence.",
